  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "be pleased with 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：be pleased with 与 be satisfied with 或 be happy about 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I think the young man will "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "be pleased with"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " this new type of suitcase."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= I think the young man "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "will be satisfied with/will be happy about"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " this new type of suitcase. 我认为年轻人会对这个新型手提箱满意的。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
